# opencode.map — per-command OpenCode frontmatter overrides.
#
# .claude/commands/*.md is the single source of truth. gen-opencode.sh derives
# .opencode/commands/*.md from it: it drops `name` and `user_invocable`, keeps
# `description`, copies the body verbatim, and appends any overrides listed here.
#
# Format (one override per line):  <command> <key> <value>
#   key ∈ { agent, model, subtask }
# Commands with no entry get description-only frontmatter (the common case).
#
# Example:
#   triage         agent    build
#   setup-release  subtask  true
#
# No overrides are currently defined — OpenCode agent routing waits on #36
# (agent definitions). The mechanism is in place for when it's needed.
